#. Tag: para
#: editor-photoediting.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All Image Editor tools like Sharpen, Blur, Noise Reduction, Refocus, Unsharp "
"Mask, &etc; use a common dialog style that previews the effect before "
"applying the filter to the current image. Below you see the &quot;Apply "
"Texture&quot; tool in action using this common dialog layout:"
msgstr ""

